From d35d12ae7ac6a22e748ab3f25f66d16e9cb40cfd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "A. Reader" <reader@example.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:36:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH bpf-next 7/8] selftests/bpf: Add count-min sketch map tests

Check that map creation refuses a key, a value without a key, a zero
width, a depth outside map_extra's lower 4 bits and too many counters;
that update, lookup, delete and get_next_key behave from user space;
that a program's push and peek agree with user space, that a peek
after a push of the same stack value loads; and that the
verifier refuses a lookup, a pop and a value shorter than value_size.
---
 .../selftests/bpf/prog_tests/count_min_map.c  | 166 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../selftests/bpf/progs/count_min_map.c       |  55 ++++++
 .../bpf/progs/count_min_map_verifier.c        |  63 +++++++
 3 files changed, 284 insertions(+)
